alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-29T17:28:40-07:00","id":1223071,"title":"","content":"I'm a little confused, maybe because I'm relatively new to these forums. Is this thread an invitation for people to brag about entertaining characters they've played or encountered in the past?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13713-wilson","name":"Wilson","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"182"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-30T12:36:31-07:00","id":1223355,"title":"","content":"This is a forum to share your best character concepts, whether you used them or not.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24271-froggo","name":"Froggo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24271_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"58"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-30T13:17:02-07:00","id":1223371,"title":"","content":"Shadowlord Kinfolk ordained as a catholic priest but has no real faith in the christian god.<br /> <br /> gives sermon's designed to manipulate people. into &quot;Stay clear of that part of the neighbourhood&quot; etc.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-30T19:16:49-07:00","id":1223478,"title":"","content":"A Red Talon Galliard that intentionally allowed itself to be captured and take to a zoo with the intention of radicalizing the animals within.<br /> <br /> AFeline Ceilican initially mistaken for a stray cat is adopted by a Bone Gnawer Sept (mostly so she stops trying to eat the local rat population). She undergoes first change upon seeing those who feed her getting attacked by Black Spiral Dancers.<br /> <br /> A Child of Gaia doctor who works for some sort of Doctors Without Borders organization. Traveling the world, healing the sick and by night seeking out the banes responsible.<br /> <br /> A really old kinfolk (60+) who's been in the sept longer than even the Garou elders. Everyone wants to kick him out as he is far too old to contribute anything to the Sept but Ancestor spirits intercede on his behalf every time anyone tries anything.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9065-darkblade","name":"Darkblade","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"78"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-02T16:50:52-07:00","id":1224240,"title":"","content":"The Peaceful Warrior, a Children of Gaia Ahroun martial artist devoted to the philosophy that the only rational purpose for mastering violence is to abolish it, focusing on her role as Protector of the Ways, defending her pack and kinfolk, as well as those considered helpless and innocent; never starting fights but being able to end them quickly.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-02T16:56:24-07:00","id":1224241,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1223016-1001-werewolf-concepts?p=1223371#post1223371\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Shadowlord Kinfolk ordained as a catholic priest but has no real faith in the christian god.</div> </div> </div> </div>I've long had a faction of the Shadow Lords (mostly Spanish and Italian in origin originally) who from the Dark Ages on believed the Christian God, especially from the Old Testament, is actually Grandfather Thunder, and have this hardline dogmatic and judgmental take on Catholicism.<br /> <br /> <br /> Added: The Gaian Inquisition*, a Shadow Lord Philodox Lupus of the Judges camp who is a dogmatic enforcer of the Litany verbatim, no ifs ands or buts, because that sort of insipid quibbling is ridiculous monkey-think and has no place in Garou law. <br /> <br /> <br /> *<sub>because no one expects the .... </sub>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":12890,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","user":"No One of Consequence","date":". 06-04-2018, 07:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-05T14:46:09-07:00","id":1225087,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>No One of Consequence</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1223016-1001-werewolf-concepts?p=1224241#post1224241\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Shadow Lord Philodox <b>Lupus</b> ... <b>dog</b>matic enforcer</div> </div> </div> </div>I see what you did there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13713-wilson","name":"Wilson","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"182"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-06T19:06:54-07:00","id":1225504,"title":"","content":"An ancient Rokea Deepwater who has lived by himself on a deserted island for so long that he has gone truly mad. He claims to have been on that island so long that he hasn't even heard of the War of Rage, much less any more recent developments, maybe that's his delusions talking, or maybe it's the truth.<br /> <br /> A Glass Walker (or Bone Gnawer if you prefer) Galliard soundcloud rapper. All of her songs contain tales of her pack's exploits wrapped up in &quot;street&quot; metaphors.<br /> <br /> The dog in <a href=\"https://www.thedodo.com/close-to-home/dog-buys-treats-using-leaf\" target=\"_blank\">this story </a>but it's a Lupus Glass Walker (probably a Ragabash).<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9065-darkblade","name":"Darkblade","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"78"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-07T07:36:36-07:00","id":1225574,"title":"","content":"A Silver Fang Metis who with 5 Pure Breed and 5 Spirit Heritage (Luna) who's powerful ancestry puts other Silver Fangs in an awkward situation if scorn and awe","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4178-stanlemon","name":"stanlemon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"209"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-08T13:45:00-07:00","id":1252596,"title":"","content":"I had a Children of Gaia Galliard. Strength 4, Stamina 4, Dexterity, 2. Intelligence 1. He had the merits &quot;Calm Heart&quot; and &quot;Lucky&quot;, and the flaws &quot;Curious&quot; and &quot;Absent Minded&quot;. He was basically a huge, good natured idiot that always seemed to get lost. <br /> <br /> I had lot of fun playing that guy...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24609-edd123","name":"edd123","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-11T16:45:34-07:00","id":1253411,"title":"","content":"A Metis Uktena Ragabash that serves as either the Caern Warder, or a Guardian by scaring away humans that come near the Bawn. Whenever anyone comes snooping around, he stealthily follows them and uses gifts to make sudden gusts of cold air, or make the place darker, and other weird creepy stuff. His metis deformity is wasting disease, so sometimes the humans will hear wheezing sounds but they never see him unless he wants them to.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13528-lordpyrus25","name":"LordPyrus25","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13528_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-13T17:40:25-07:00","id":1254036,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>stanlemon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1223016-1001-werewolf-concepts?p=1225574#post1225574\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A Silver Fang Metis who with 5 Pure Breed and 5 Spirit Heritage (Luna) who's powerful ancestry puts other Silver Fangs in an awkward situation if scorn and awe</div> </div> </div> </div>On the flip side: I had a side NPC I called &quot;Trashcan Jan.&quot; She was a local Bone Gnawer, born a Pure Breed 1 Silver Fang Metis. Everyone thought that was a great name, but nobody happened to ask her about it and find out that she's named after where the local sept found her as a baby. They'd also have to think to ask the elders about her to find out that she still had a kin-fetch attached.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13544-impeesa","name":"Impeesa","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"21"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-19T15:45:49-07:00","id":1255600,"title":"","content":"Just watched Dog Soldiers, the werewolves in that movie would make great Red Talons!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24271-froggo","name":"Froggo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24271_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"58"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-19T23:47:10-07:00","id":1255664,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Froggo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1223016-1001-werewolf-concepts?p=1255600#post1255600\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just watched Dog Soldiers, the werewolves in that movie would make great Red Talons!</div> </div> </div> </div>Nah man, these are Black Spiral Dancers. Scotland, they live in a house (Talons don't do that) and they have chill human body larder.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-23T09:17:54-07:00","id":1256726,"title":"","content":"Middle Brother's Memory, a Metis Uktena Galliard fixated on uncovering and preserving the legends, lore and legacy of the Croatan, and trying to use it to bring about closer relations between his/her tribe and the Wendigo. <br /> <br /> Name Breakers' Bane, a homid Uktena Ahroun, full-blooded Chickasaw witch hunter from the Gulf Coast, keeping dangerous secrets and objects out of the hands of ignorant human &quot;mages&quot; and &quot;sorcerers&quot; who, much like small children with loaded firearms, have no business with such things. (Credit where it's due: this idea is largely inspired by the character Red Shoes from Gregory Keyes's Age of Unreason series.)<br /> <br /> Daughter of the Monkey King, a homid Uktena ragabash of Chinese decent whose insatiable curiosity and need to poke things is forever getting her and her friends in trouble.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-27T17:29:07-07:00","id":1257687,"title":"","content":"The Mordred, a Metis Silver Fang Theurge, a child of incest (by both mortal and Garou standards) whose father and his advisors tried to have killed at birth, raised by his &quot;witch&quot; mother, possessing a great deal of ruthless cunning and ambition, with the dark destiny of bringing about the end of his father's control over a powerful and noteworthy regional Protectorate. <br /> <br /> The Hamlet, a Homid Silver Fang Philodox with an overdeveloped sense of justice and revenge, seeking to avenge his father's death from inter-House politicking and perceived treachery. <br /> <br /> The Noble Savage, a Lupus Silver Fang Ahroun of the Ice Pack, cast in the mold of characters like Tarzan and Conan, a paragon of physical virtue and blunt honesty, harkening back to Tribe's original glory. <br /> <br /> The Blackadder, a Homid Silver Fang Ragabash from Britain, the archetypical conniving upper-class weasel, most notable for his snarky wit, self-advancing schemes, and strong sense of self preservation. <br /> <br /> The Don Quixote, a Homid Silver Fang Galliard, the last of the true believers in chivalry, honor and knighthood in a world that has no longer has a place for such things.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-12T03:06:11-07:00","id":1260260,"title":"","content":"A blind Metis Bone Gnawer Philodox. The son of an capable but unremarkable Fianna Ahroun prize fighter (cast out and forced to join the Gnawers with his son for his crime) and a Black Fury Theurge (abandoned her son and joined the Sisters of Mercy for atonement). Knowing his own existence is a crime he takes a little too much on his plate, both protecting the defenceless and punishing the guilty with equal resolve, knowing full well it'll get him killed one day.<br /> <br /> A Homid Black Fury Ragabash. Goaded on by a kinfolk sister she jumped into being a Garou with a little too much enthusiasm. Striking out onto the streets on her own without a pack she made some terrible mistakes and ended up dominated and enslaved by a Vampire. It took her the better part of a year to break his hold and escape. The memories of what she did while under his thrall still haunt her but she does what she can to drown them out,<br /> <br /> A Homid Bone Gnawer Ahroun. A late bloomer who didn't undergo his first change until his mid-twenties while in prison for a crime he didn't commit. When he eventually came to he was miles away from the prison and covered in blood. He took on an new identity and laid low for years before meeting an elderly Bone Gnawer and learning the truth of what he is.<br /> <br /> A Homid Stargazer Galliard. Born to Glass Walker Kinfolk that tragically died when their private plane went down in the Himilayas he managed to survive and was taken in by a sept of Stargazers. He trained in their ways and joined the tribe when he under went his first change. Alas the call of the home he once knew was too much and he abandoned his post and returned to the city to reclaim his birth right.<br /> <br /> A Homid Glass Walker Ahroun. Another late bloomer, who never thought he'd be a true Garou warrior. He joined the marines and had a successful if morally dubious career, unbeknownst to him being watched over by the totem Clashy Boom Boom. She kept him alive through every battle so that he could properly serve her one day. Unfortunately on his last tour he uncovered proof that members of his unit were being turned into fomori. Upon returning to the US he tried to make contact with some Garou relatives to let them know about what he found. His attempts were intercepted by his former CO who arranged for a hit against his family in hopes of keeping him quiet. As his family were murdered he at long last under went his first change.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9065-darkblade","name":"Darkblade","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"78"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}